Description:
    Save TreeSummarizedExperiment into file artifacts, and load them back into
    memory. This is a more portable alternative to serialization of such
    objects into RDS files. Each artifact is associated with metadata for
    further interpretation; downstream applications can enrich this metadata
    with context-specific properties.
